  "ai_language_tip": "Start in Estonian (et); in Tallinn and Ida-Virumaa many businesses also serve in Russian, and English is widely understood among younger staff. Switch only when the other side offers.",
  "english_ok": "often — Good in Tallinn and Tartu, hotels, restaurants and IT-savvy services; weaker in small-town clinics, garages and with older staff.",
  "politeness": "Reserved, brief and factual; formal 'Teie' with strangers; open with 'Tere' / 'Tere päevast'; little small talk; close with 'Aitäh, head aega'.",
  "name_tip": "Booking 'nimele …' (first name or surname); Estonian names are not gendered by ending; spell Latin letters with õ, ä, ö, ü clearly.",
  "phone_tip": "Mobile 5XXX XXXX (7–8 digits, e.g. 5 12345678), landline 6XX XXXX in Tallinn, international +372; no trunk 0; SMS and email confirmations are standard.",
  "time_tip": "Watch out: 'pool kaheksa' = 7:30 (half to eight), 'veerand kaheksa' = 7:15, 'kolmveerand kaheksa' = 7:45; written times use 24h ('19.30'); always read back in 24h.",
  "number_tip": "Mobile numbers are usually read in groups of 3–4; Estonian numerals for teens end in '-teist' and tens in '-kümmend'.",
  "avoid_calling": "Avoid restaurant peaks 12:00–13:00 and 18:30–20:00, calls after 20:00, and Sundays for non-hospitality; Midsummer (23–24 June) and Christmas Eve to Boxing Day are largely closed.",
  "closed_days": "Shops and restaurants usually open on Sunday; offices and most clinics closed weekends; public holidays incl. 24 February, Good Friday, Easter, 1 May, Pentecost, 23–24 June, 20 August, 24–26 December.",
  "booking_channels": "Digiregistratuur for state-funded specialist appointments; family doctor practices by phone/e-mail; Bolt Food DineOut, venue websites and booking widgets for restaurants; Wolt and Bolt Food for delivery; salons via online booking widgets or phone.",
  "voice_menu": "Family doctor advice line 1220, Haigekassa, banks, Telia/Elisa/Tele2 and Omniva use IVR; many clinics have a phone menu for registration; restaurants answer directly.",
  "callback_habits": "Digiregistratuur and clinics send SMS/e-mail reminders; restaurants confirm online bookings automatically; small businesses call back or text.",
